{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:20:45Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"Cmdr's o7", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:20:49Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"32n2p", "Message":"o7", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:20:56Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"o7 CMDR", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:20:58Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"akv9m", "Message":"o7", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:21:46Z", "event":"Friends", "Status":"Online", "Name":"9cty2" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:22:49Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"Anyone else excited to see the Corsair tomorrow?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:23:18Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"Hopefully they gave it a nose/cockpit job. :D", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:23:33Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"akv9m", "Message":"It's on the livestream tomorrow?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:23:53Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"Believe so, they said it would be shown in game I think on the tweets.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:23:59Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9cty2", "Message":"big nose ship cannot haul much cargo! :-(", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:24:04Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"akv9m", "Message":"I'm quite excited.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:24:12Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"I'm excited to see what it offers, and yes I also hope they have taken into account user feedback regarding its looks", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:24:41Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"They said last time she is meant to be well endowed in the cargo department. Would be typical Fdev to make it the best Medium hauler. :D", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:25:05Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9cty2", "Message":"but it does have an incredibly large nose!", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:25:15Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"akv9m", "Message":"Makes Type-8, powercreeps it in less than a year.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:25:20Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"If you look at some of the concept pics, the cockpit actually looks more forward on the side view.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:26:01Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"Yeah I'd like to see a slim or more agressive nose too.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:26:37Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"9zfqy", "Message":"why not just give us the Imperial Trader from Elite 2, is that so much to ask?", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:26:39Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"I hope they give it some seats too, be really bad if it gets 1 seat for a medium", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:26:57Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"32n2p", "Message":"no way there isnt any multicrew seats", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-03-25T21:27:13Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"84cy5", "Message":"I reckon the other ships this year will be Large, so might see another Imperial big girl. :)", "Channel":"squadron" }
